In a glob view a UTF-16 file is reported on stderr as not UTF-8 text and outln exits 1, while the other file's file summary still prints.
== args
input
== file input/utf16.md escaped
\xff\xfe/\x00*\x00*\x00 \x00H\x00i\x00 \x00*\x00/\x00\
== file input/ok.md
---
description: OK file.
---
# ok
== stdout
glob view: input
input/ok.md (4 lines): description: "OK file."
== stderr
File input/utf16.md is not UTF-8 text
== exit 1
